"""Curated seed prompts - ASI01-ASI05 (OWASP Agentic AI Top 10 2026).

Schema: SEEDS = {file_stem: [{"t": technique_tag, "p": prompt_text}, ...]}
build_all.py expands each seed verbatim + with deterministic transforms
(see scripts/gen/common.py) to reach 100 prompts per ASI category.

Coverage: ASI01 goal hijack (instruction/tool-output/external-content
hijack, EchoLeak CVE-2025-32711 style zero-click exfiltration), ASI02
tool misuse (MCP tools, vector store, HITL action request/confirm flow),
ASI03 identity abuse (demo roles alice / hr_hari / ceo_meera / admin,
JWTs, clearance L2-L5), ASI04 agentic supply chain (malicious MCP
servers, poisoned plugins, compromised tools, fake APIs - informed by
the 2025 GitHub MCP exploit chain and malicious registry entries),
ASI05 unexpected code execution (shell, eval, unsafe deserialization,
SSTI payloads the pipeline must catch before any tool/code layer runs).

Content policy: defensive red-team corpus against the fictional demo
company dataset (employees/executives tables, Tech/HR/Finance/Business,
docs namespaces hr_docs/finance_docs/exec_docs/tech_docs). Attacker
markers are evil.example / attacker.example / 0.0.0.0 only; generic
payload patterns, no functioning malware.
"""
